{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:757c0e4995cb853878512cf621f259b078fe160deb6436e2593093e144e3fd15",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43591d643b71e9789318a3e88613a86ff14cf4966a504802c5ebbfdf5c6dd457",
      "text": "甜甜圈推荐派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35352ee99bed8e11e8e675fe3238339c192eb6784850e8b9b80ee3c9f645ffee",
      "text": "隼人等人为了春名的生日，开始筹备派对。\n四季提议礼物就送甜甜圈，\n于是在当天，大家各自带了自己觉得最好吃的\n甜甜圈来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de42509e8bdf3bd8f25a063574f3b690502dc82656d0a66ddda7251c6894dab0",
      "text": "终于到春名的生日了！\n大家，甜甜圈都准备好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb2286883e3668e497f9119c61f210db92537ba3797d5079ce576825a7b9159f",
      "text": "当然啦！我选的华丽风甜甜圈，\n你就好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2540f1aba5761205a426c5bf4b1184446e6c8949f0841d8ed9f7158fb231dee",
      "text": "虽然我对甜甜圈不是很懂，\n但也按我自己的标准精心挑选了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b60cb6ac301181b0e5974da990fe89bdf90318bee12c340ea93190fbe3925f",
      "text": "我也是……春名，\n要是能高兴……就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f8389f84ee0bbfd3fcc82c7ed72a5fba0ea900379af6955962a0fea0792e334",
      "text": "嗯！\n好想快点看到春名开心的笑脸啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:283c7d31dcd6a4cccc0b87a203449056b9baae8aa50df2babe4423c41ea101e6",
      "text": "隼人挑给我的甜甜圈，是蒸烤的呢，\n挺少见的啊。那是在哪里买的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dacad9b938a4ddc7f6ba50999a88db5a60ee74747f029358845c14a46b41e14e",
      "text": "是我边逛边吃的时候发现的店。\n回头我发在LINK上给你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcfd43843a20b02460395eaeb75ecc41ae45e5f94be2d5342af15af70f4f82f7",
      "text": "毕竟甜甜圈大多是油炸的嘛，\n我想着这样会不会就不会跟别人撞了～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fae65013057e85a2b7522c4594982709839f2ac4600782ea63853bd0af3904a",
      "text": "是这样啊！\n很好吃哦，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d809ffe8753a830f126047cd2793a9a4db113b9f407030f6493cf96646d3fff",
      "text": "你能喜欢就太好了！呐，下次社团活动\n结束后一起去店里吃刚出炉的怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89f02bceb73b7c5ad833cb0decdb9e103f236742dc03dfde51e4403ae5b4e66e",
      "text": "刚出炉的！？去去去！\n练习变得更有干劲了。好期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79876066125156ff5c42dc103ecd21d6c1434ef44ec01defa85395aa4c754d27",
      "text": "旬送我的甜甜圈，总觉得该怎么说呢……\n怎么说好呢，虽然说不太上来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e24a1c30ef736dd1b1f4d8a080496c77f37ee8f0005de77def5ff3159e259980",
      "text": "难不成是不合春名先生的口味吗？\n抱歉，是我调查不够充分……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c3b069258fbce027feeaabde301a607dc7fef8df92f66f1ff622dd2df6bad0",
      "text": "没没没，正相反，正相反！超级好吃的！\n该说是……成熟的风味？这种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3645fd42e7a0d261872379ebd36e654832a10a134a98c7dc42b447e3dd9d4e",
      "text": "据说是讲究原材料的商品。\n确实那款有着沉稳的口感呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:832f9170a83a65f6a258b5dc7a4a031776560097f9b382f904e49d75b373fb9b",
      "text": "对对，跟我平时吃的甜甜圈完全不一样啊。\n亏你能找到这种东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6725e64b2aea35e25eb2239ef139700b6b81ac1eceeb0f5acd53c48a486291e",
      "text": "毕竟百货商店里有很多西点专卖店呢。\n有机会的话，大家一起去看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b0de5d89c5d7a702cb10740406c2343d0e06a0253787d6c1cf622d7fa5355b",
      "text": "那个猫咪甜甜圈真有夏来的风格啊。\n既好吃又可爱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48445b45451c7e1e58ffc5e92e2248e6672e48f3457a52b02d3e49476014d2c9",
      "text": "嗯……在店里看到时……就觉得非它莫属了……\n白猫也、黑猫也，都很可爱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d14776beb3d38ab70869995852b776251371624f9295825c64046f08d1a59cf2",
      "text": "……嗯？我拿到的好像是三花猫的甜甜圈吧。\n还有其他品种吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99178dff1052c83e255bc2f07a97942e458184e8287845ea15284fe6b85f1adf",
      "text": "嗯……白猫是，牛奶味的。黑猫是……\n苦巧克力的味道。还有……橘虎斑、白斑猫也有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:159e9e5b89caaf3c11bf03da46af8153cbee67fdb355a212bdfd95c210768fe9",
      "text": "哇啊，每个看起来都好好吃！夏来，下次带我\n去那家甜甜圈店吧。我全都要买！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8972454748b963b7acc4ef690b4206e86d7a0db119bde5f120422f84b29acf1c",
      "text": "……好呀。下次，带你去……\n在店里，一起吃吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30011a8c284a3c5135db494680b1c42ec037d8988a588f173ce6e6079f13d1ac",
      "text": "春名亲春名亲！难得的机会，\n不和华丽甜甜圈一起拍张照吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60fa4d6f5bf2e08423b7b42f47a57ba809400847deb2b5e18083a2742cfedde",
      "text": "不错啊，就是所谓的出片吧。也能留作今天的纪念呢。\n像这样，拿着甜甜圈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eefe4884253046232031b730ad111f43afcfba7227d79dceff5be49fa2db0041",
      "text": "哇～很有架势哦！春名亲，\n手臂能再抬高一点，视线看这边吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1404199088daec56f026999e084533fc3573d0fd5c8aaf06b536bc3e57d02235",
      "text": "原来如此，这样吗？……不对，这种感觉怎么样？\n甜甜圈看起来更有魄力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef33b6270b3a367a9d802586876f84519e1ee9e8404a27f2593aa7f6a6a36b7",
      "text": "哦哦哦，Mega上镜啊！保持这样\n摆个帅气表情！很好很好，太棒啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_023har_2_1_2_023_12:1_2_023_12_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:028bf0bb28bc266307c3650ed3fa57e0c5313cd0ed830f812956e52ba4809147",
      "text": "……一直拿着甜甜圈我都快忍不住了。\n不行了，我开动啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
